54
00:06:57,417 --> 00:06:59,752
Die, both of you!

55
00:06:59,753 --> 00:07:03,548
Hands up! Police! Don't move!

56
00:07:07,427 --> 00:07:08,595
Put down your weapon!

57
00:07:13,725 --> 00:07:14,808
- Get him!
- Yes, sir!

58
00:07:14,809 --> 00:07:15,810
Move!

59
00:07:16,478 --> 00:07:19,313
-  Go after him!
-  Stop right there!

60
00:07:19,314 --> 00:07:20,482
Stop, Noh Manhui!

61
00:07:22,025 --> 00:07:23,443
- Stop right there!
- Get moving!

62
00:07:25,070 --> 00:07:26,404
Don't let him get away!

63
00:07:26,946 --> 00:07:28,739
-  Stop, Noh Manhui!
-  Stop, you punk!

64
00:07:28,740 --> 00:07:29,741
- Arrest him.
-  Yes, sir.

65
00:07:30,367 --> 00:07:31,450
Mr. Kang Taeju.

66
00:07:31,451 --> 00:07:33,160
Get up.

67
00:07:33,161 --> 00:07:35,497
-  Stop right there, Noh Manhui!
-  I said stop!

68
00:07:36,665 --> 00:07:37,749
Go after him!

69
00:07:39,334 --> 00:07:40,418
Noh Manhui!

70
00:07:41,086 --> 00:07:43,837
Mr. Kang, for solicitation
of kidnapping and murder,

71
00:07:43,838 --> 00:07:45,798
- theft and impersonating a public--
- Seyun!

72
00:07:45,799 --> 00:07:46,800
Don't move!

73
00:07:47,300 --> 00:07:50,594
You have the right to remain silent,

74
00:07:50,595 --> 00:07:53,263
