81
00:08:21,835 --> 00:08:22,877
Noh Manhui!

82
00:08:24,045 --> 00:08:25,046
Hey!

83
00:08:28,383 --> 00:08:29,466
Stop right there, punk!

84
00:08:29,467 --> 00:08:31,009
- Stop!
-  Careful.

85
00:08:31,010 --> 00:08:32,094
Hey, Noh Manhui!

86
00:08:32,095 --> 00:08:33,680
Stop!

87
00:08:37,100 --> 00:08:38,309
- Go that way!
-  That prick.

88
00:08:47,777 --> 00:08:49,111
That way. You two, that way.

89
00:08:49,112 --> 00:08:50,696
- Yes, sir.
- Move it! This way.

90
00:08:50,697 --> 00:08:52,282
Hey, to the left…

91
00:08:59,622 --> 00:09:00,623
Don't move!

92
00:09:13,386 --> 00:09:15,554
I have to go, okay?

93
00:09:15,555 --> 00:09:16,890
I have to go!

94
00:09:17,557 --> 00:09:19,976
I have to go!

95
00:09:20,810 --> 00:09:22,228
I have to go!

96
00:09:47,504 --> 00:09:49,546
We have to get out of…

97
00:09:49,547 --> 00:09:51,257
Oh, gosh, Gyeongae.

98
00:09:54,052 --> 00:09:57,221
- What happened? Tell me.
-  Are you okay?

99
00:09:57,222 --> 00:09:59,015
I said, are you okay?

100
00:09:59,766 --> 00:10:02,768
You can't even handle a…
Hold on.

101
00:10:02,769 --> 00:10:04,937
Don't touch me.

102
00:10:04,938 --> 00:10:08,108
- Let's get you to the hospital.
- I can't move right now! Don't touch me.

103
00:10:09,651 --> 00:10:10,777
Oh, no.

104
00:10:13,530 --> 00:10:14,738
You have to leave me.

105
00:10:14,739 --> 00:10:17,742
I'm not going anywhere alone!

106
00:10:19,160 --> 00:10:20,161
Noh Manhui.

107
00:10:20,829 --> 00:10:23,123
- Huh?
- Don't get caught, okay?

108
00:10:24,332 --> 00:10:27,335
Just come back for me. You got that?

109
00:10:29,003 --> 00:10:30,212
Okay, babe? Babe.

110
00:10:30,213 --> 00:10:32,715
You have to come back for me.
You got that?

111
00:10:35,051 --> 00:10:36,970
Go, already! Go on.

112
00:10:37,595 --> 00:10:41,014
I said go already! I swear to God…

113
00:10:41,015 --> 00:10:42,725
I'll be right back.

114
00:10:44,978 --> 00:10:47,313
I'll be back to get you.

115
00:10:48,523 --> 00:10:50,108
- Okay?
-  Okay.

116
00:11:00,118 --> 00:11:01,411
Just go!

117
00:11:03,037 --> 00:11:04,455
Don't you dare get caught!

118
00:11:04,873 --> 00:11:06,499
Get out of here!

119
00:11:07,542 --> 00:11:08,543
Hurry!

120
00:11:31,941 --> 00:11:34,569
BABY ON BOARD
61K 9024

121
00:12:16,611 --> 00:12:18,904
It seems…

122
00:12:18,905 --> 00:12:20,365
We're searching the house first.

123
00:12:35,838 --> 00:12:36,839
Search the place.

124
00:12:57,694 --> 00:13:02,615
THE HUSBAND

125
00:13:04,701 --> 00:13:06,326
Hey, help them tape off the area.

126
00:13:06,327 --> 00:13:07,411
Yes, sir.

127
00:13:15,295 --> 00:13:17,880
EMERGENCY SERVICES, AMBULANCE

128
00:13:21,175 --> 00:13:23,802
Luckily, it looks like the impact
missed the vital organs.

129
00:13:23,803 --> 00:13:26,889
- Still, we should get him checked out.
- Got it.

130
00:13:28,558 --> 00:13:29,559
Well…

131
00:13:30,643 --> 00:13:33,438
Detective, what's going on with my wife?
Is she okay?

132
00:13:34,063 --> 00:13:35,440
You don't get to ask about her.

133
00:13:38,484 --> 00:13:40,027
Is she conscious?

134
00:13:40,028 --> 00:13:43,239
Mr. Kang. You're under arrest right now.

135
00:14:01,924 --> 00:14:04,010
Hey, don't move. It's okay.

136
00:14:04,927 --> 00:14:06,095
Where…

137
00:14:07,138 --> 00:14:08,472
Where am I?

138
00:14:08,473 --> 00:14:09,556
In an ambulance.

139
00:14:09,557 --> 00:14:12,101
Don't you remember what happened at all?

140
00:14:13,853 --> 00:14:14,854
Ms. Ko Seyun.

141
00:14:16,022 --> 00:14:17,065
How are you feeling?

142
00:14:18,399 --> 00:14:22,528
Oh, I'm Detective Jang Dosik.
Captain of Major Crimes at Seongjin PD.

143
00:14:23,613 --> 00:14:24,739
Police…

144
00:14:26,282 --> 00:14:27,450
Where's my husband?

145
00:14:28,159 --> 00:14:29,826
What happened to my husband?

146
00:14:29,827 --> 00:14:32,371
Oh, don't worry about him.
He's been arrested.

147
00:14:33,331 --> 00:14:34,623
Arrested? Why?

148
00:14:34,624 --> 00:14:37,834
If you could just calm down,
we'll tell you everything in due--

149
00:14:37,835 --> 00:14:40,545
No. Where is he?

150
00:14:40,546 --> 00:14:42,298
I have to see him right now.

151
00:14:46,886 --> 00:14:47,887
Honey!

152
00:14:57,063 --> 00:14:58,064
Seyun.

153
00:15:00,942 --> 00:15:01,943
Seyun.

154
00:15:03,569 --> 00:15:04,570
Are you all right?

155
00:15:06,322 --> 00:15:07,948
Yeah, I'm fine.

156
00:15:07,949 --> 00:15:09,033
That's good.

157
00:15:13,246 --> 00:15:16,999
What… Why… But why are you…

158
00:15:18,918 --> 00:15:20,669
Why are you in handcuffs?

159
00:15:20,670 --> 00:15:22,255
Why…

160
00:15:22,964 --> 00:15:24,757
You didn't do anything wrong.

161
00:15:25,466 --> 00:15:28,052
He's suspected of soliciting
your kidnapping and murder.

162
00:15:29,470 --> 00:15:31,389
It's not him you want.

163
00:15:32,557 --> 00:15:34,724
What do you mean?

164
00:15:34,725 --> 00:15:38,396
The real culprits were a married couple.

165
00:15:39,105 --> 00:15:40,355
A couple?

166
00:15:40,356 --> 00:15:42,692
Yes, the guy abducted me,

167
00:15:43,276 --> 00:15:47,821
and the woman pretended
to be another victim in the next room.

168
00:15:47,822 --> 00:15:49,073
They're absolutely insane.

169
00:15:53,703 --> 00:15:56,455
I'm telling you,
he's here to save my life!

170
00:16:00,626 --> 00:16:01,751
Okay, we'll take note.

171
00:16:01,752 --> 00:16:04,297
We'll look into that
as part of our investigation.

172
00:16:05,381 --> 00:16:07,174
Mr. Kang, let's go.

173
00:16:07,175 --> 00:16:08,342
Wait, but…

174
00:16:18,519 --> 00:16:19,520
Let's go.

175
00:16:25,276 --> 00:16:26,819
Captain.

176
00:16:27,612 --> 00:16:28,863
We've lost the suspect.

177
00:16:29,530 --> 00:16:32,783
One of our officers was
attacked during the pursuit.

178
00:16:34,869 --> 00:16:36,204
- Choi.
- Yes, sir.

179
00:16:36,704 --> 00:16:39,080
Set up checkpoints
within a 10-kilometer radius

180
00:16:39,081 --> 00:16:40,832
and call in neighboring precincts.

181
00:16:40,833 --> 00:16:41,959
Copy that.

182
00:16:44,295 --> 00:16:47,214
Also, we've located
a female inside the suspect's residence.

183
00:16:47,215 --> 00:16:49,508
Her lower-body pain
is too severe to transport her.

184
00:17:05,274 --> 00:17:07,610
EMERGENCY SERVICES, AMBULANCE

185
00:17:14,075 --> 00:17:15,159
Is it serious?

186
00:17:17,662 --> 00:17:19,455
Mr. Kang, this way.

187
00:17:23,626 --> 00:17:25,210
How's she looking?

188
00:17:25,211 --> 00:17:27,921
She has paralysis below the waist
and is in severe pain.

189
00:17:27,922 --> 00:17:30,549
She strongly resists
any attempt to examine her,

190
00:17:30,550 --> 00:17:33,594
so we can't check her vitals
or perform basic first aid.

191
00:17:34,178 --> 00:17:37,265
It'd be best to have a doctor's evaluation
before we transport her.

192
00:18:04,750 --> 00:18:06,502
Try moving your leg.

193
00:18:19,348 --> 00:18:20,474
Can you not move it?

194
00:18:21,726 --> 00:18:23,310
What about your back?

195
00:18:25,813 --> 00:18:29,065
It hurts.

196
00:18:29,066 --> 00:18:30,067
Doctor.

197
00:18:30,776 --> 00:18:32,862
We found these meds on the desk.

198
00:18:39,827 --> 00:18:42,370
PRESCRIPTION, KIM GYEONGAE
WOORI TOGETHER MEDICAL CENTER

199
00:18:42,371 --> 00:18:44,707
RELIEVES NERVE PAIN
FROM SPINAL NERVE COMPRESSION

200
00:18:52,214 --> 00:18:53,633
Help me.

201
00:19:05,311 --> 00:19:07,521
So, how's she looking?

202
00:19:10,650 --> 00:19:12,817
She has a pre-existing spinal condition.

203
00:19:12,818 --> 00:19:17,198
It looks like the trauma caused
acute hemorrhaging at the lesion site.

204
00:19:17,823 --> 00:19:20,700
Based on her pain response,
the bleeding and swelling

205
00:19:20,701 --> 00:19:22,912
will likely worsen
the spinal cord compression.

206
00:19:24,246 --> 00:19:26,081
I… I don't really…

207
00:19:26,082 --> 00:19:30,086
The pressure on her spinal cord
is causing the tissue to die.

208
00:19:32,254 --> 00:19:36,759
If she doesn't get surgery right now,
her legs will be permanently paralyzed.

209
00:19:37,426 --> 00:19:39,512
If it gets any worse, she may even die.

210
00:19:43,891 --> 00:19:45,518
Help me, please.

211
