RESIDENT REGISTRATION CARD

226
00:22:53,372 --> 00:22:55,124
What's this guy's deal?

227
00:23:13,017 --> 00:23:14,852
Oh, you have got to be kidding me.

228
00:23:28,240 --> 00:23:29,324
What did you find?

229
00:23:29,325 --> 00:23:33,912
Hey, Captain, we've recovered
