232
00:23:40,002 --> 00:23:41,420
We'll need to investigate these.

233
00:23:42,046 --> 00:23:44,047
Secure the scene and the evidence.

234
00:23:44,048 --> 00:23:45,966
Get Forensics out there immediately.

235
00:23:48,093 --> 00:23:50,095
Yeah. Tell them it's urgent.

236
00:24:11,784 --> 00:24:14,036
