no signs of serious injury.

245
00:25:15,681 --> 00:25:17,724
She's severely dehydrated
and malnourished,

246
00:25:17,725 --> 00:25:19,601
- so we've started her on IV fluids.
- I see.

247
00:25:21,437 --> 00:25:22,521
You'll be fine, my dear.

248
00:25:23,439 --> 00:25:24,440
Okay.

249
00:25:29,987 --> 00:25:31,488
Hey, Seyun. You all right?

250
00:25:32,531 --> 00:25:33,781
Chiung.

251
00:25:33,782 --> 00:25:36,827
Do you have any idea
how worried I was?

252
00:25:37,578 --> 00:25:39,204
This is all so crazy.

253
00:25:40,664 --> 00:25:41,748
I'm so relieved.

254
00:25:41,749 --> 00:25:43,167
Thank goodness you're all right.

255
00:25:46,712 --> 00:25:48,379
