261
00:26:11,987 --> 00:26:14,739
Apparently, they're with the person
who kidnapped Ms. Ko.

262
00:26:14,740 --> 00:26:15,741
What?

263
00:26:16,784 --> 00:26:19,495
Are you saying those criminals
are at the hospital right now?

264
00:26:20,120 --> 00:26:23,706
