actually rescued Ms. Ko.

265
00:26:23,707 --> 00:26:24,708
What…

266
00:26:25,334 --> 00:26:27,336
So he had her kidnapped
and then rescued her?

267
00:26:27,878 --> 00:26:29,670
What on earth are you talking about?

268
00:26:29,671 --> 00:26:31,714
Something feels off.

269
00:26:31,715 --> 00:26:33,842
It's as if the cops
actually believe Dr. Kang.

270
00:26:36,220 --> 00:26:37,346
Where are they right now?

271
00:26:56,615 --> 00:26:59,076
Captain, are you sure about this?

272
00:26:59,785 --> 00:27:01,829
Shouldn't we take them
straight to the station?

273
00:27:04,206 --> 00:27:05,207
Run her info.

274
00:27:05,791 --> 00:27:09,128
See if she's gotten a scan
at this hospital before.

275
00:27:12,381 --> 00:27:14,215
PATIENT INFORMATION
KIM GYEONGAE

276
00:27:14,216 --> 00:27:16,885
Yes, we've got her MRI
from six months ago.

277
00:27:26,395 --> 00:27:28,063
What are you doing here?

278
00:27:29,690 --> 00:27:31,108
What do you think you are doing?

279
00:27:31,942 --> 00:27:34,653
What are these criminals
doing at my hospital?

280
00:27:35,404 --> 00:27:37,446
Dr. Ko, if you could please calm down…

281
00:27:37,447 --> 00:27:39,658
How am I supposed to calm down right now?

282
00:27:40,242 --> 00:27:43,244
Please don't get the wrong idea.
Mr. Kang is still under arrest.

283
00:27:43,245 --> 00:27:45,122
But she's in such critical condition that…

284
00:27:45,706 --> 00:27:46,956
Critical?

285
00:27:48,542 --> 00:27:50,711
Be that as it may,

286
00:27:51,837 --> 00:27:55,256
these people are criminals
that did horrible things to my daughter.

287
00:27:55,257 --> 00:27:57,134
How could I let them in my hospital?

288
00:27:57,801 --> 00:27:59,303
That is just ridiculous!

289
00:28:03,640 --> 00:28:05,767
You, say something.

290
00:28:06,351 --> 00:28:08,185
Have you forgotten what you've done?

291
00:28:08,186 --> 00:28:12,023
You orchestrated the hit on my daughter,

292
00:28:12,024 --> 00:28:15,861
you broke into my home with a gun
and took three billion won from me.

293
00:28:16,486 --> 00:28:18,906
You really think you have
any right to be in this room?

294
00:28:21,074 --> 00:28:23,493
Well, I took the money for a reason.

295
00:28:24,620 --> 00:28:26,454
What are you even saying?

296
00:28:26,455 --> 00:28:28,999
I couldn't tell you at the time,

297
00:28:29,666 --> 00:28:33,127
but I needed it as bait
to lure out the culprit.

298
00:28:33,128 --> 00:28:36,214
What? A bait?

299
00:28:37,174 --> 00:28:41,178
Yes, I was planning to give it back
as soon as I got Seyun back.

300
00:28:44,306 --> 00:28:46,807
Detective. Is this true?

301
00:28:46,808 --> 00:28:48,226
Is he telling the truth?

302
00:28:49,186 --> 00:28:52,688
We can't be sure yet,
but a lot of Ms. Ko's statements

303
00:28:52,689 --> 00:28:54,608
align with what Dr. Kang is saying.

304
00:28:55,359 --> 00:28:57,945
But we'll have to investigate further.

305
00:29:01,406 --> 00:29:02,491
Okay, fine.

306
00:29:03,450 --> 00:29:05,202
Let's say you're telling the truth.

307
00:29:05,786 --> 00:29:09,206
Then where's my three billion?

308
00:29:10,165 --> 00:29:11,333
Let me see it now!

309
00:29:12,834 --> 00:29:14,628
I put it in my trunk.

310
00:29:15,337 --> 00:29:16,421
What?

311
00:29:17,631 --> 00:29:21,009
I put it in the trunk
of the car I was driving.

312
00:29:22,386 --> 00:29:23,679
- Check the trunk.
-  Yes, sir.

313
00:29:24,388 --> 00:29:27,557
Wait, you believe
what this bastard is saying?

314
00:29:28,475 --> 00:29:30,018
Well, I don't,

315
00:29:30,936 --> 00:29:32,562
so get him out of here!

316
00:29:34,022 --> 00:29:35,399
And that criminal too.

317
00:29:36,024 --> 00:29:41,237
She's developed an expanding hematoma
due to acute hemorrhage within the tumor.

318
00:29:41,238 --> 00:29:44,157
If we don't take action,
it'll completely compress her spinal cord.

319
00:29:45,534 --> 00:29:47,244
If she doesn't get surgery right now,

320
00:29:48,412 --> 00:29:50,539
she's not going to survive this, sir.

321
00:29:53,250 --> 00:29:54,251
So,

322
00:29:55,335 --> 00:29:58,422
you're asking to have her
operated on at our hospital?

323
00:29:59,131 --> 00:30:00,424
That criminal?

324
00:30:02,801 --> 00:30:06,638
We have to find out
who kidnapped Seyun and why.

325
00:30:07,472 --> 00:30:10,642
If she dies, we'll never
get to the truth, Father.

326
00:30:20,318 --> 00:30:21,319
No way.

327
00:30:24,698 --> 00:30:25,741
Dr. Ko.

328
00:30:26,491 --> 00:30:29,244
I understand this situation
may be quite upsetting for you,

329
00:30:30,078 --> 00:30:31,662
but he does have a point.

330
00:30:31,663 --> 00:30:34,373
What on earth are you trying to say?

331
00:30:34,374 --> 00:30:36,209
Don't be ridiculous.

332
00:30:37,044 --> 00:30:39,171
I'm the director of this hospital!

333
00:30:40,297 --> 00:30:45,259
Plus, do you think anyone
would take on this surgery?

334
00:30:45,260 --> 00:30:46,887
No doctor here would be up for it!

335
00:30:47,637 --> 00:30:49,139
I'm doing this surgery.

336
00:30:52,142 --> 00:30:53,143
What?

337
00:30:55,395 --> 00:30:57,397
Why on earth are you doing this?

338
00:30:58,273 --> 00:30:59,357
What are you plotting?

339
00:31:00,233 --> 00:31:03,904
If you think I have ulterior motives,
you can watch over me as I operate.

340
00:31:04,488 --> 00:31:05,781
I don't mind.

341
00:31:08,950 --> 00:31:11,286
Have you lost your damn mind?

342
00:31:14,539 --> 00:31:15,624
No way!

343
00:31:17,042 --> 00:31:18,210
Get him out of here!

344
00:31:19,252 --> 00:31:21,171
And get that woman out of here too!

345
00:31:21,922 --> 00:31:22,923
Please let him do it.

346
00:31:26,426 --> 00:31:27,427
Seyun.

347
00:31:31,264 --> 00:31:32,265
Dad.

348
00:31:34,935 --> 00:31:36,645
Let Taeju operate on her.

349
00:31:37,312 --> 00:31:40,523
Seyun, that woman is a criminal.

350
00:31:40,524 --> 00:31:43,985
Not just any criminal.
She's the one who kidnapped you.

351
00:31:46,113 --> 00:31:47,447
I know,

352
00:31:48,031 --> 00:31:49,866
but I want to know why they did this

353
00:31:50,408 --> 00:31:52,077
and why they kidnapped me.

354
00:31:53,036 --> 00:31:54,996
I want to know the truth.

355
00:32:12,180 --> 00:32:14,224
Why won't this prick pick up?

356
00:32:17,936 --> 00:32:19,813
Come on, damn it.

357
00:33:07,194 --> 00:33:10,822
This space is for doctors
and patients only.

358
00:33:11,489 --> 00:33:13,658
Please wait outside for a moment.

359
00:33:17,078 --> 00:33:18,830
He's in handcuffs, isn't he?

360
00:33:20,290 --> 00:33:21,708
I'll take full responsibility.

361
00:33:25,337 --> 00:33:26,546
Okay. I understand.

362
00:33:32,469 --> 00:33:34,053
Give us the room.

363
00:33:34,054 --> 00:33:35,429
I'll handle the rest.

364
00:33:35,430 --> 00:33:36,473
Yes, sir.

365
00:33:44,564 --> 00:33:48,526
You belong behind bars, not in an OR.

366
00:33:50,904 --> 00:33:52,948
Is it a criminal-to-criminal thing?

367
00:33:53,782 --> 00:33:56,785
Or are you taking care of your accomplice?

368
00:34:02,165 --> 00:34:06,503
Why on earth did I ever
accept you into my family?

369
00:34:07,587 --> 00:34:08,755
I know.

370
00:34:10,048 --> 00:34:11,924
Why did you?

371
00:34:11,925 --> 00:34:13,760
I'm wondering the same thing myself.

372
00:34:21,268 --> 00:34:22,894
How are you going to do this surgery?

373
00:34:24,688 --> 00:34:26,523
I'm going to do it by the book.

374
00:34:27,023 --> 00:34:28,191
"By the book"?

375
00:34:29,484 --> 00:34:32,153
Sure, you should, as a doctor.

376
00:34:33,571 --> 00:34:37,242
But not all life is of equal value.

377
00:34:40,370 --> 00:34:42,289
That woman is not a patient.

378
00:34:42,872 --> 00:34:44,791
She put your wife in danger

379
00:34:46,251 --> 00:34:48,503
and tried to take her life.

380
00:34:54,384 --> 00:34:56,845
The OR is a strange place.

381
00:34:57,846 --> 00:35:00,015
Even if you prepare
for every possible scenario,

382
00:35:01,433 --> 00:35:04,019
you still run into unexpected situations.

383
00:35:05,312 --> 00:35:09,649
But that's not the doctor's fault, is it?

384
00:35:20,660 --> 00:35:22,078
- Take off his cuffs.
- Yes, sir.

385
00:36:32,399 --> 00:36:34,900
This is only until the surgery's over.

386
00:36:34,901 --> 00:36:38,405
I'll be watching,
so don't do anything stupid.

387
00:36:39,155 --> 00:36:40,740
Don't forget you're still a suspect.

388
00:36:41,700 --> 00:36:42,742
Understood.

389
00:36:51,292 --> 00:36:53,294
Captain, are you sure about this?

390
00:36:54,003 --> 00:36:55,630
What if something goes wrong?

391
00:36:57,465 --> 00:36:58,717
Let's see how it goes.

392
00:36:59,926 --> 00:37:01,010
Yes, sir.

393
00:37:37,130 --> 00:37:39,798
What are you… What the hell are you doing?

394
00:37:39,799 --> 00:37:41,967
Sir, what are you doing?

395
00:37:41,968 --> 00:37:44,303
Please! Please don't do that!

396
00:37:44,304 --> 00:37:46,556
Please pull her up! Please, sir!

397
00:37:55,815 --> 00:37:57,900
Watch your precious daughter die!

398
00:37:57,901 --> 00:37:59,151
-  Seyun!
-  Seyun!

399
00:37:59,152 --> 00:38:00,486
-  No!
- Honey!

400
00:38:00,487 --> 00:38:03,530
Just because you're rich,
you think you can mock me?

401
00:38:07,410 --> 00:38:10,246
You're sorry?
Well, sorry's not going to cut it.

402
00:38:14,250 --> 00:38:16,001
You bastard!

403
00:38:16,002 --> 00:38:17,879
I'm going to kill you!

404
00:38:18,421 --> 00:38:21,758
I'm… I'm going to…

405
00:38:22,675 --> 00:38:28,306
I'm going to find you
and tear you to pieces, you bastard!

406
00:39:38,459 --> 00:39:39,961
I'll operate on you.

407
00:39:45,425 --> 00:39:47,260
Don't worry, I'm a doctor.

408
00:39:48,636 --> 00:39:51,014
It's my job and duty to save lives.

409
00:39:57,937 --> 00:39:58,938
But…

410
00:40:03,151 --> 00:40:04,652
After what you did to my wife…

411
00:40:08,156 --> 00:40:09,574
When I think about that…

412
00:40:11,868 --> 00:40:14,037
Maybe you're not worth saving.

413
00:40:22,378 --> 00:40:24,255
Ready to start anesthesia.

414
00:40:56,871 --> 00:41:00,707
The MRI shows that the bleeding
occurred quite a while ago,

415
00:41:00,708 --> 00:41:02,585
resulting in an extensive hematoma.

416
00:41:03,586 --> 00:41:06,798
We'll remove the hematoma first,
and then proceed with hemostasis.

417
00:41:07,590 --> 00:41:09,175
Anesthesia, any issues?

418
00:41:15,139 --> 00:41:17,308
All clear. Vitals are stable.

419
00:41:17,976 --> 00:41:19,393
Let's get started.

420
00:41:19,394 --> 00:41:20,395
Ten blade.

421
00:41:38,371 --> 00:41:41,040
Exposing the field. Retractor.

422
00:41:45,753 --> 00:41:47,922
Starting the laminectomy. Drill.

423
00:42:00,476 --> 00:42:03,813
I see a subdural hematoma
caused by tumor hemorrhage.

424
00:42:04,272 --> 00:42:06,189
There is severe spinal cord compression.

425
00:42:06,190 --> 00:42:07,817
I’m going to make the dural incision.

426
00:42:10,069 --> 00:42:11,070
Eleven blade.

427
00:42:15,575 --> 00:42:16,576
Suction.

428
00:42:21,539 --> 00:42:22,540
Forceps.

429
00:42:39,390 --> 00:42:41,600
The hematoma's mostly cleared.

430
00:42:41,601 --> 00:42:44,312
Let's double-check it
then re-check the bleeding site.

431
00:42:54,238 --> 00:42:56,574
There's active bleeding at the tumor base.

432
00:42:57,283 --> 00:42:58,534
Bipolar.

433
00:43:01,829 --> 00:43:03,705
Turn the bipolar down, please.

434
00:43:03,706 --> 00:43:04,957
Turning the bipolar down.

435
00:43:06,167 --> 00:43:08,586
The OR is a strange place.

436
00:43:10,713 --> 00:43:13,132
Even if you prepare
for every possible scenario,

437
00:43:14,342 --> 00:43:16,677
you still run into unexpected situations.

438
00:43:20,098 --> 00:43:24,685
But that's not the doctor's fault, is it?

439
00:43:40,660 --> 00:43:41,661
Dr. Kang!

440
00:43:48,501 --> 00:43:49,627
Dr. Kang!

441
00:43:54,340 --> 00:43:55,842
Dr. Kang, are you okay?

442
00:44:02,431 --> 00:44:04,100
D-Dr. Kang?

443
00:44:06,853 --> 00:44:07,936
Gelatin sponge, please.

444
00:44:07,937 --> 00:44:09,437
SPONGE USED TO STOP BLEEDING

445
00:44:09,438 --> 00:44:10,648
Give me the whole thing.

446
00:44:15,528 --> 00:44:16,945
We need more gelatin sponge.

447
00:44:16,946 --> 00:44:18,281
Gelatin sponge coming up.

448
00:44:30,585 --> 00:44:33,004
Dr. Kang,
we still have bleeding. Dr. Kang!

449
00:44:37,842 --> 00:44:39,134
We need more gauze.

450
00:44:39,135 --> 00:44:40,553
- STAT!
-  I got it.

451
00:44:43,139 --> 00:44:44,140
I got more gauze.

452
00:44:44,724 --> 00:44:46,809
Why isn't he getting
the bleeding under control?

453
00:44:47,560 --> 00:44:49,061
What's going on in there?

454
00:44:52,857 --> 00:44:54,609
Anesthesia, are vitals stable?

455
00:44:55,234 --> 00:44:57,069
Heart rate is climbing. We're at 140.

456
00:44:57,653 --> 00:44:58,946
Gauze, please.

457
00:45:03,826 --> 00:45:05,327
The bleeding isn't stopping!

458
00:45:05,328 --> 00:45:07,121
-  Transfusion, please.
-  On it.

459
00:45:11,751 --> 00:45:13,628
BP is still tanking. We're at 60 over 30!

460
00:45:16,547 --> 00:45:17,548
Dr. Kang!

461
00:45:39,487 --> 00:45:40,655
What just happened?

462
00:45:41,239 --> 00:45:42,907
-  More gauze, please.
-  Got it.

463
00:45:46,077 --> 00:45:47,286
The bleeding's slowing.

464
00:45:47,787 --> 00:45:48,788
Suction.

465
00:45:49,705 --> 00:45:51,290
Anesthesia, how are the vitals?

466
00:45:51,791 --> 00:45:53,917
They're still unstable.

467
00:45:53,918 --> 00:45:55,168
We need more blood.

468
00:45:55,169 --> 00:45:57,046
I'll request more units
from the blood bank.

469
00:46:12,103 --> 00:46:13,521
The immediate crisis is over,

470
00:46:14,522 --> 00:46:16,190
and her vitals are steady for now.

471
00:46:19,694 --> 00:46:20,861
Good job.

472
00:46:22,029 --> 00:46:23,489
Well done,

473
00:46:24,991 --> 00:46:26,450
saving that woman.

474
00:46:28,327 --> 00:46:29,328
Mr. Kang.

475
00:46:30,162 --> 00:46:32,164
The bag of money you mentioned…

476
00:46:33,499 --> 00:46:35,084
It wasn't in the trunk.

477
00:46:36,168 --> 00:46:37,753
What are you talking about?

478
00:46:39,213 --> 00:46:41,298
I definitely put it in the trunk.

479
00:46:43,426 --> 00:46:44,802
I knew it.

480
00:46:46,095 --> 00:46:47,888
You were planning to return the money?

481
00:46:49,974 --> 00:46:53,311
You're putting on an act after hiding
that money somewhere, aren't you?

482
00:46:54,645 --> 00:46:56,771
No, that's not it, Father. I swear.

483
00:46:56,772 --> 00:47:00,276
Stop it.
I am absolutely disgusted.

484
00:47:01,986 --> 00:47:03,737
I'm going down to the station

485
00:47:03,738 --> 00:47:06,282
to formally press charges
against him tomorrow.

486
00:47:09,618 --> 00:47:11,704
You see who he truly is now?

487
00:47:14,457 --> 00:47:15,458
Let's go.

488
00:47:16,542 --> 00:47:17,793
Get up. Come on.

489
00:47:25,468 --> 00:47:27,178
Dr. Ha. A moment.

490
00:47:35,311 --> 00:47:36,604
Let's go down to the station.

491
00:47:38,230 --> 00:47:39,648
- Cuff him.
- Yes, sir.

492
00:48:06,133 --> 00:48:10,429
SEONGJIN POLICE STATION
SAFE SEONGJIN, TRUSTED POLICE

493
00:48:11,555 --> 00:48:13,057
Okay, let's go over this again.

494
00:48:13,849 --> 00:48:16,309
You met Lee Suhyeong
while you were being interrogated

495
00:48:16,310 --> 00:48:19,897
about your wife's abduction,
and you fled to meet him?

496
00:48:21,357 --> 00:48:24,276
- Yes.
- I don't quite understand.

497
00:48:25,319 --> 00:48:26,612
Why did you run?

498
00:48:27,780 --> 00:48:32,742
Mr. Lee told me that he'd help me
find out where my wife was.

499
00:48:32,743 --> 00:48:35,829
He said the guy did
the same thing to his wife.

500
00:48:35,830 --> 00:48:36,831
I mean…

501
00:48:37,331 --> 00:48:40,583
Sure, he said he knew
your wife's whereabouts,

502
00:48:40,584 --> 00:48:43,295
but how could you trust
a total stranger so easily?

503
00:48:44,088 --> 00:48:45,548
He was different.

504
00:48:47,716 --> 00:48:49,552
He wasn't like you people.

505
00:48:50,636 --> 00:48:55,391
At least he knew I wasn't behind this.

506
00:48:58,269 --> 00:48:59,770
And that's why you did as he said?

507
00:49:02,690 --> 00:49:05,650
I had no choice. I had to save my wife.

508
00:49:05,651 --> 00:49:06,861
You had no choice, huh?

509
00:49:08,320 --> 00:49:11,073
You ran from a police investigation,

510
00:49:12,032 --> 00:49:14,368
infiltrated the NFS with a fake ID,

511
00:49:15,119 --> 00:49:19,165
robbed your own in-laws, opened fire,
and attempted murder.

512
00:49:19,832 --> 00:49:21,917
And you nearly got Detective Park killed.

513
00:49:23,627 --> 00:49:26,255
You expect me to believe
you did all this to save your wife?

514
00:49:29,800 --> 00:49:33,220
That's exactly what a man
who wants to save his wife would do.

515
00:49:34,847 --> 00:49:37,057
I told you from the beginning
that it wasn't me.

516
00:49:37,641 --> 00:49:39,601
That I don't even know who he is.

517
00:49:39,602 --> 00:49:41,687
And what did you do?

518
00:49:42,771 --> 00:49:46,192
Did any of you actually listen?
No. You just pegged me as an accomplice.

519
00:49:48,027 --> 00:49:51,864
My wife could've died
while you were wasting time.

520
00:49:53,199 --> 00:49:54,825
So put yourselves in my shoes.

521
00:49:56,076 --> 00:49:57,661
What would you have done?

522
00:49:59,538 --> 00:50:00,539
As for me,

523
00:50:01,499 --> 00:50:05,377
I had to do whatever it took to save her.

524
00:50:13,886 --> 00:50:15,053
You sent this, right?

525
00:50:15,054 --> 00:50:16,680
RESIDENT REGISTRATION CARD
NOH MANHUI

526
00:50:19,266 --> 00:50:20,267
Yeah.

527
00:50:21,393 --> 00:50:22,728
Why did you send it?

528
00:50:24,188 --> 00:50:26,314
Because I found the real perp.

529
00:50:26,315 --> 00:50:28,817
Wasn't that a calculated move
to build yourself an alibi?

530
00:50:30,986 --> 00:50:36,158
Honestly,
I still don't know what to believe.

531
00:50:36,784 --> 00:50:40,286
Whether you were actually
trying to save your wife,

532
00:50:40,287 --> 00:50:43,123
or you just ended up saving her
when things went sideways.

533
00:50:43,958 --> 00:50:44,959
Fine.

534
00:50:45,459 --> 00:50:49,380
Let's say you're telling the truth.
But what about the money?

535
00:50:49,880 --> 00:50:51,214
Where is that three billion?

536
00:50:51,215 --> 00:50:53,841
I told you. I left it in the trunk.

537
00:50:53,842 --> 00:50:55,844
We searched the whole thing
but found nothing.

538
00:50:56,971 --> 00:50:59,223
So be honest with us, Mr. Kang.

539
00:51:02,601 --> 00:51:04,353
Nothing's changed, has it?

540
00:51:04,937 --> 00:51:06,021
Let's just drop it.

541
00:51:06,855 --> 00:51:09,400
You have no intention
of believing a word I say anyway.

542
00:51:17,533 --> 00:51:20,577
Once your arrest warrant is issued,
you'll be locked up for a while.

543
00:51:20,578 --> 00:51:22,746
You should probably get used to this.

544
00:51:51,775 --> 00:51:56,614
CHICKEN & BEER

545
00:52:08,292 --> 00:52:10,169
Ugh, what the hell?

546
00:52:18,927 --> 00:52:21,221
Hey, can you move your car so I can go?

547
00:52:37,071 --> 00:52:40,323
Authorities have confirmed
that one of the primary suspects

548
00:52:40,324 --> 00:52:44,119
in the recent hospital
kidnapping case remains at large.

549
00:52:44,745 --> 00:52:48,122
- What the hell is wrong with this guy?
- Police have issued a nationwide APB

550
00:52:48,123 --> 00:52:49,916
for 42-year-old Noh Manhui
and are tracking him.

551
00:52:54,797 --> 00:52:57,549
Hey. I said, move your car.

552
00:52:58,842 --> 00:53:01,720
Geez, do you not hear me? Move it already!

553
00:53:04,973 --> 00:53:06,058
Okay, I will.

554
00:53:06,934 --> 00:53:09,103
Are you kidding me right now?

555
00:53:10,521 --> 00:53:12,690
I should just kill that prick. Seriously…

556
00:53:13,190 --> 00:53:15,733
Couldn't he just do it
when I asked the first time?

557
00:53:15,734 --> 00:53:18,319
Why did he have to piss me off?
I should just--

558
00:53:27,454 --> 00:53:28,956
You should've just left.

559
00:53:29,748 --> 00:53:31,041
I said I'd move it.

560
00:53:32,000 --> 00:53:33,210
Can't you hear me?

561
00:53:34,420 --> 00:53:35,671
I said, can't you hear me?

562
00:53:37,339 --> 00:53:39,007
Answer me, you prick.

563
00:53:42,845 --> 00:53:48,892
WOORI TOGETHER MEDICAL CENTER

564
00:53:58,944 --> 00:54:02,739
STAIRWELL
FIRE DOOR, KEEP CLOSED

565
00:54:02,740 --> 00:54:08,912
DO NOT PLACE OBJECTS
NEAR FIRE DOOR

566
00:54:55,667 --> 00:54:57,419
Hello? Yes, Doctor.

567
00:54:58,212 --> 00:54:59,630
Yes, I'll come to you.

568
00:55:16,021 --> 00:55:19,358
WING 102 ROOM 07
KIM G.A

569
00:56:31,638 --> 00:56:37,269
POTASSIUM CHLORIDE

570
00:57:05,922 --> 00:57:07,049
Dr. Kang!

571
00:57:12,554 --> 00:57:14,181
What are you doing right now?

572
00:57:17,768 --> 00:57:18,769
Potassium chloride?

573
00:57:20,479 --> 00:57:22,439
Giving undiluted IV potassium chloride

574
00:57:23,565 --> 00:57:26,902
would cause hyperkalemia
and cardiac arrest.

575
00:57:27,861 --> 00:57:30,030
You're a doctor, so surely you knew that.

576
00:57:34,701 --> 00:57:35,869
Dr. Ha Jeongsoo.

577
00:57:37,621 --> 00:57:41,249
I knew all along that she was a patient
at our hospital and that you were

578
00:57:42,209 --> 00:57:43,710
her attending physician.

579
00:57:46,088 --> 00:57:48,548
Why would this woman,
who was your patient…

580
00:57:50,550 --> 00:57:52,302
kidnap my wife?

581
00:57:56,682 --> 00:57:59,059
And why are you trying
to kill this woman now?

582
00:58:03,021 --> 00:58:04,146
That's…

583
00:58:04,147 --> 00:58:06,900
The Dr. Ha I know
would never do anything like this.

584
00:58:13,949 --> 00:58:15,075
Who is it?

585
00:58:17,536 --> 00:58:19,204
Who's calling the shots?

586
00:58:26,586 --> 00:58:28,547
Is it Director Ko Dongchan?

587
00:58:38,306 --> 00:58:39,433
It's him, right?

588
00:58:42,686 --> 00:58:47,606
THE HUSBAND

589
00:59:27,606 --> 00:59:30,733
The entire future of
this hospital is riding on this project.

590
00:59:30,734 --> 00:59:31,901
What's going on here?

591
00:59:31,902 --> 00:59:33,861
What if
the whole world finds out?

592
00:59:33,862 --> 00:59:36,364
Seyun will have to shoulder all of that.

593
00:59:37,657 --> 00:59:40,326
We don't know what else
we'll find, so search every inch.

594
00:59:40,327 --> 00:59:41,619
What the hell is this?

595
00:59:41,620 --> 00:59:44,163
Where's my grandma? Where is she?

596
00:59:44,164 --> 00:59:46,415
I honestly don't know anything.

597
00:59:46,416 --> 00:59:48,334
I was only doing what I was told.

598
00:59:48,335 --> 00:59:49,627
That was Dr. Ha, wasn't it?

599
00:59:49,628 --> 00:59:50,753
Taeju?

600
00:59:50,754 --> 00:59:53,130
You and Kim Gyeongae.

601
00:59:53,131 --> 00:59:54,924
What is the connection between you two?

602
00:59:54,925 --> 00:59:56,634
If you want to know so badly,

603
00:59:56,635 --> 00:59:59,637
ask that woman once she wakes up.

604
00:59:59,638 --> 01:00:01,640
Translated by Hyun Sik Yoon
